{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/react-table"},{"type":"text","value":" adapter is a wrapper around the core table logic. Most of its job is related to managing state the \"react\" way, providing types and the rendering implementation of cell/header/footer templates."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"usereacttable","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useReactTable"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Takes an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object and returns a table."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useReactTable } from '@tanstack/react-table'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = useReactTable(options)\n\n  // ...render your table\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"usereacttable","text":"useReactTable","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `@tanstack/react-table` adapter is a wrapper around the core table logic. Most of its job is related to managing state the \"react\" way, providing types and the rendering implementation of cell/header/footer templates.\n\n## `useReactTable`\n\nTakes an `options` object and returns a table.\n\n```tsx\nimport { useReactTable } from '@tanstack/react-table'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = useReactTable(options)\n\n  // ...render your table\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: React Table\n---\n\nThe `@tanstack/react-table` adapter is a wrapper around the core table logic. Most of its job is related to managing state the \"react\" way, providing types and the rendering implementation of cell/header/footer templates.\n\n## `useReactTable`\n\nTakes an `options` object and returns a table.\n\n```tsx\nimport { useReactTable } from '@tanstack/react-table'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = useReactTable(options)\n\n  // ...render your table\n}\n```\n"}
